{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3729, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2729, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 5350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4010, "text": "Sir? Come on in."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 8290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5750, "text": "I brought you that motion for\ncontinuance to look at, sir."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 14490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10670, "text": "I think I got something in my eye."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 17130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16129, "text": "You see anything?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 20290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18930, "text": "Pretty nauseating, huh?"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 21910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20770, "text": "Well, I love Halloween."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 23490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22350, "text": "You ready for the party tonight?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 24990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23710, "text": "My insurance has paid up, yes."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 27890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26170, "text": "Hey, you didn't have a good time last\nyear?"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 30850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28410, "text": "I believe the high point was when my\nappetizer bit me."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 33810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32110, "text": "Uh, excuse me, sir."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 37770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34430, "text": "Matt, Miss Sullivan thinks that our\nHalloween parties are too grotesque."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 40410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38150, "text": "Now, why would you say something like\nthat?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 47890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44430, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry, sir. Uh, have you two\nbeen introduced?"}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 50590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49410, "text": "This is Petey."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 53230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51990, "text": "And two, Matt."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 56650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53590, "text": "I hope this thing is okay. They were\nfresh out of sucking chest wounds."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 62700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58540, "text": "box contain what I think it does? Your\nimplements of torture have arrived, sir."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 65980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62940, "text": "Now, let's take a look. Oh, licorice\nwhip."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 69040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67820, "text": "Comedy meat cleaver."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 71440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70440, "text": "What's that in the corner?"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 72660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71660, "text": "It's a goblin."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 76440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72940, "text": "Oh, now, you see, why can't you get more\nthings like that? It's cute and it's"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 83280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76440, "text": "cuddly and... Let's see Ken and Barbie\ntry"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 84280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83280, "text": "that one."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 92210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91210, "text": "to analysis."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 96610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92830, "text": "Uh, sir, I confirm your refreshments for\nthe night's festivities."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 98030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96910, "text": "Yeah, finger sandwiches?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 102030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98230, "text": "Oh, very realistic, Your Honor. I\nthought maybe we could hook them over"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 103030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102030, "text": "of the dip bowl."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 111350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105630, "text": "Hello. Well, hello there, Mrs. Lund.\nHow's everything up in juvenile"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 113430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111750, "text": "Well, it's just fine, Mr. Robinson."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 117030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 114870, "text": "Oh, this is my friend."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 119390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117510, "text": "I've kind of gotten attached to him."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 125920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 123180, "text": "Don't mind Matt, Mrs. Lund. Something's\nbeen eating at him all day."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 131500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 127740, "text": "Want to come to our party tonight? I\nthink I got a wound for you here. No,"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 132500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131500, "text": "no, please, please."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 136060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133280, "text": "Your Honor, I have some news about Leon."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 138760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 137340, "text": "Leon? You found him?"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 139980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138980, "text": "He's back in Manhattan."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 141240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140240, "text": "Where is he? What happened?"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 145500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141880, "text": "Apparently, he has been living on the\nstreet for the past six months since he"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 146159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145500, "text": "ran away."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 148880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146160, "text": "He was caught stealing food from a\ngrocery store."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 150220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 149220, "text": "He's in custody?"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 152000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150680, "text": "No, he escaped."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 158320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 153320, "text": "Amazingly enough, it seemed that he\nslipped out of his handcuffs as if by"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 166280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 159920, "text": "Now, who do you suppose could have\ntaught Leon a trick like that?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 170580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 167500, "text": "Well, he was eager to learn."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 175260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171680, "text": "You know what they say, a mind is a\nterrible thing to waste."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 224640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223080, "text": "Sir, any news on Leon?"}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 225940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224940, "text": "Nothing."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 231600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226680, "text": "Mac, I feel like I'm the reason Leon ran\noff in the first place. Sir, don't"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 232600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231600, "text": "torture yourself."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 238840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235860, "text": "At least not so close to lunchtime."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 244760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240780, "text": "Mac, this... You're so helpless."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 247800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245280, "text": "Look, sir, look, don't worry about it."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 252300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248160, "text": "Mrs. Lund said if Leon came to see\nanybody, it would probably be you."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 255090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 253390, "text": "He trusts you, sir. He'll come."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 257350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256170, "text": "I hope you're right, Mac."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 259649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258649, "text": "I'll be there in a minute."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 261870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260850, "text": "Ready when you are, sir."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 303220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300780, "text": "I think it would compromise our working\nrelationship."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 306700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304960, "text": "Vince. Good to see you, Mr."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 309020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306960, "text": "Prosecutor. Apparently, I didn't know\nhow good."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 311260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310260, "text": "You're taking identity."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 313500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312500, "text": "Quite an outfit."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 315980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313580, "text": "We just had our office Halloween party.\nHow was it?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 317660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316660, "text": "What can I say?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 318860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317740, "text": "I'm a party animal."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 323560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320840, "text": "We're going to have a party in my office\nlater. If you want to drop by, we'll"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 325440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323560, "text": "probably be able to scare up an acorn\nfor you."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 327880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325920, "text": "I can't. I'm having a party in my place."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 331280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328460, "text": "That's right, I heard about that. Now,\nwho mentioned that to me?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 333460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332140, "text": "Oh, please!"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 336960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335700, "text": "Let me come to your party."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 338760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337600, "text": "I remember now."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 341180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340180, "text": "No, Dan."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 345740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341520, "text": "I am begging you. Dan! Take my word for\nit, I'm on my knees! Dan, you are not"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 347340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345740, "text": "invited. You aren't going."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 351400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347600, "text": "If you mention it again, I'm going to\nmake your life a living purgatory."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 352780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351780, "text": "Got that?"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 357820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356440, "text": "I said..."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 359960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358960, "text": "Got that."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 362920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361920, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 365420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364420, "text": "We're on it."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 372040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369160, "text": "How would you like to be put in a\nshoebox with no holes in the lid?"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 375560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373760, "text": "So you roll over and fetch, too? Hey!"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 380600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376640, "text": "Big deal, I wouldn't go to Daniel's\nstupid party now if he begged me."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 382180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381000, "text": "Who's going to be there anyway?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 383540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382540, "text": "The mayor."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 388440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387440, "text": "That's what I heard, Dan."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 393800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389500, "text": "The suck -up opportunity of the century,\nand he's going to make me miss it."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 401160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395900, "text": "Dan, you can come to my party and suck\nup. I could slobber all over you any"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 402160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401160, "text": "time."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 404400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403400, "text": "This is special."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 407640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405100, "text": "I know, Danny, but you've got to be\nbrave."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 410280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408220, "text": "Come on, I want to see a big camper."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 412840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411840, "text": "Yeah, sure, fine."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 415780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413660, "text": "So he wants it. I still have some\ndignity left."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 417780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416780, "text": "I'll offer him cash."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 422440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420260, "text": "Can't that man take no for an answer?"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 428340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423960, "text": "That was a rhetorical question."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 436580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432260, "text": "Your Honor, this is Miss Yankovic's\nfourth appearance here for prostitution"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 437580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436580, "text": "as many months."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 441000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438420, "text": "It's been quite a summer."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 451230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449610, "text": "wishes to throw herself in the mercy of\nthe court."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 457770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451470, "text": "Your Honor, decency and aesthetics\ndemand the maximum."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 460630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459630, "text": "Sir?"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 462790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461790, "text": "Over here, boy."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 467370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465470, "text": "Sir? You okay?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 470210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468250, "text": "Oh. Sorry, guys."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 472170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470430, "text": "Guess I got stuff on my mind."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 474130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473130, "text": "Intense longing?"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 477530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475970, "text": "Combined with subconscious guilt?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 480340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478160, "text": "and feelings of paternal inadequacy."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 483340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482340, "text": "That's just a guess."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 489980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486740, "text": "Don't worry, Shirley. I'll come to see\nyou. I just know it."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 492400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490240, "text": "I wish I had your confidence, Miss\nSullivan."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 494320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 492700, "text": "I wish I had her body."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 498640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496520, "text": "That darn gravity, eh, Mary?"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 510140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508140, "text": "to come to a party later tonight."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 512620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510540, "text": "We're going to play bobbing for\nbirthmarks."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 518120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514799, "text": "Thanks, but I never mix business with\nbobbing."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 521659, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520659, "text": "Conviction reports."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 525300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522580, "text": "Oh! I dropped my piano music."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 529660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526420, "text": "I couldn't play my piano without it,\ncould I? What's that?"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 531900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530000, "text": "Yes, I do play, as a matter of fact."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 536060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533300, "text": "You know, I'm in such great... Great\ndemand, because there's nothing like a"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 537920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536060, "text": "piano to play to make any gathering a\nsuccess."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 541580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540580, "text": "No, Dan."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 543360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541880, "text": "I do impressions, too."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 546080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544780, "text": "Dan, get this straight."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 550120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546540, "text": "I don't want you at my party. I don't\nwant you in my apartment."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 552480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550460, "text": "I don't want you in the same zip code."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 554820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553560, "text": "I detest you."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 561020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 555460, "text": "My fondest wish is to see you writhing\nin the dirt as you die from a gut wound."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 566490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565290, "text": "Good job on those files."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 570870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569370, "text": "I hate your little suit."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 575810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574810, "text": "Sir."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 580790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576150, "text": "Sir. The wide world of guts just\ndelivered the rest of your party favors."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 584410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582830, "text": "Don't you want to look at them, sir?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 586810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585050, "text": "No, my heart isn't in it."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 588770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587150, "text": "Oh, yes, it is. It's right here."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 601970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600970, "text": "Gutsy broad."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 605590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604310, "text": "I need a recess."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 607990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606990, "text": "Take ten."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 614490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612650, "text": "What in God's name am I doing?"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 618030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615730, "text": "I believe it's called an autopsy."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 629690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624570, "text": "Oh, I appreciate you trying to cheer me\nup, but believe me, now is not the time."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 631240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630240, "text": "Hi, Harry."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 635460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634460, "text": "Leon."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 638880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635740, "text": "So, how would you like your steak?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 649020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648020, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 652000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649680, "text": "Leon, you sure shot up, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 653780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 652780, "text": "Sort of."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 657640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654900, "text": "Those guys must be hot in these things."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 659920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657920, "text": "I really missed you. Stay away."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 663690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661550, "text": "I was just going to hug you. No hugs."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 668190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664090, "text": "Not till we establish some mutually\nacceptable but utterly inviolable ground"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 669190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668190, "text": "rules."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 673290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670510, "text": "Boy, vampires say the darndest things."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 677350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674270, "text": "You have to promise that I can go any\ntime I want to."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 680410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677690, "text": "Leon. Okay, adios, amigo. All right, all\nright."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 682290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681130, "text": "You got my word."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 687230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682610, "text": "As a judge and as the world's tallest\nliving mouseketeer."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 690830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689270, "text": "You really are weird, Harry."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 693140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692140, "text": "Can I have a hug now?"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 698640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 697640, "text": "Have a ball."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 703960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 702160, "text": "You know, I was worried about you, guy."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 708140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704680, "text": "Why? Why? You were gone six months.\nWhere were you?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 710380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 708420, "text": "California. I was living on a beach."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 712380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710600, "text": "For six months? It was a nude beach."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 715040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714040, "text": "I see."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 716080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715080, "text": "So did I."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 718400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717400, "text": "Why'd you come back?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 722430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721230, "text": "I said, why'd you come back?"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 727130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723970, "text": "Sir, your presence is urgently requested\nin the courtroom."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 732330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730630, "text": "Could you at least RSVP?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 735350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734350, "text": "I'll be right there."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 738810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737450, "text": "Leon, you and I got to talk."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 741750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739350, "text": "You stay here, and I'll come back on my\nmeal break."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 744490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742010, "text": "Okay, as long as you don't say anything\nto anyone else."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 745750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744750, "text": "You got that."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 750170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 747310, "text": "Uh, Leon, you didn't actually steal\nanything, did you?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 753720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750980, "text": "Three pounds of spam. Ate most of it\nbefore they caught me."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 756600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755120, "text": "Well, I guess you've suffered enough."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 763039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762040, "text": "Hey, Mac."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 764160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763040, "text": "How you doing, sir?"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 765700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764380, "text": "I feel like a million bucks."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 769160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766040, "text": "All right, people, we got justice to\ndish out, and it's getting cold."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 771760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770400, "text": "Sir! Sir!"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 775500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772200, "text": "Leon! Oh, Bull, I know. I saw him in\nyour office."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 780000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776120, "text": "Naturally, I wanted to keep him there,\nso I snuck into the room and jumped him"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 780829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780000, "text": "from behind."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 781830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780830, "text": "You what?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 785150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782290, "text": "Unfortunately, he managed to run up my\nchest and escape over my back."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 788150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787150, "text": "He's gone."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 789430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788430, "text": "Oh, no."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 792630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 789730, "text": "I know, sir. We were this close to\nhaving him."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 796190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794030, "text": "Boo, boo, boo."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 799350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797130, "text": "You big, sweet..."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 819570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818570, "text": "need a shine."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 836310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830410, "text": "I wish you wouldn't do that, sir."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 840210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837830, "text": "Oh, Mac, it's just so frustrating."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 842130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841130, "text": "Uh -huh."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 846770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842550, "text": "I mean, I had him. I had him right here\nuntil Bull..."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 848580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847020, "text": "Rain dookie on your parade, sir."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 855880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850880, "text": "Yeah. Sir, he feels bad about it. He\nwants to make it up to you. He's looking"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 856980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855880, "text": "all over for that boy."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 858920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857920, "text": "Sir!"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 876230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873450, "text": "not find that little wretched street\nurchin suit, I am going to be late for"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 877230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876230, "text": "Daniel's party."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 878650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877510, "text": "You were invited to it?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 880310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879310, "text": "No, I'm crashing it."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 884790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881610, "text": "Dan, you'll have your head on a plate.\nYou will never know I'm going to be in"}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 889090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884790, "text": "costume. I'm just going to slip in,\ndazzle the mayor with a few charming"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 891530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889090, "text": "anecdotes about my life, and then slip\nright out."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 894310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891830, "text": "You don't have a few charming anecdotes\nfrom your life, Dan."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 895590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894590, "text": "I know."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 897030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896030, "text": "That's why I wrote something."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 901610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 898910, "text": "All right, people, let's try to get some\nwork done, huh?"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 904500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903440, "text": "Your Honor, you look like hell."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 906360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905360, "text": "Thank you, Dan."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 910140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906680, "text": "You look emotionally whipped. Why don't\nwe wrap it up and you take a good rest"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 912360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910140, "text": "tonight? You in some kind of hurry,\nFielding?"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 915540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914000, "text": "Somebody get a tranquilizer gun."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 916880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915880, "text": "Leon!"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 918480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917480, "text": "Okay, kid, please!"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 922060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921060, "text": "Hold what?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 924260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922140, "text": "Or I'll poke a three -inch deep hole in\nyour forehead."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 928500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926120, "text": "Or I'll put that thing away before\nsomeone gets hurt."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 935900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934440, "text": "just didn't know about our arrangement."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 937359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936360, "text": "What arrangement?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 939980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937360, "text": "He said I could leave any time I wanted\nto. He said that?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 941500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940340, "text": "You promised, Harry."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 942980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941800, "text": "You promised him?"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 944300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943220, "text": "Come on, I'm getting dizzy."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 947480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945820, "text": "All right, yeah, I promised him."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 950680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948780, "text": "I can't believe you're gonna let this\nchild go."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 952440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951000, "text": "I mean, if you cared about him at all."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 954540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952660, "text": "Well, maybe I don't care about him that\nmuch."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 960420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956820, "text": "You're right, Leon. I promised. You're\nfree to go. Good luck to you in your"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 961420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960420, "text": "future endeavors."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 965460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961880, "text": "Now maybe we can all go back to our own\nlives. Here, here. Now, about that"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 966460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965460, "text": "adjournment, sir."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 969320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966960, "text": "Excuse me. First, you pick up your\nlittle gavel."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 974020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970700, "text": "Did you say you didn't care that much?\nYes, he did say that. Now, run along."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 975200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974200, "text": "Uncle Danny's in a big hurry."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 979520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978420, "text": "That's what I said, Leon."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 981600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980560, "text": "Right, just checking."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 984880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983260, "text": "But you do care a little bit, right?\nHey!"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 987040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985560, "text": "Why don't you get out of here?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1010140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006920, "text": "That kid's stuff is an act he turns on\nand off whenever he wants to con"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1011620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010140, "text": "somebody. You look at him!"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1014940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013140, "text": "There's no little kid left in there."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1020280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015840, "text": "He's a mature, cold, calculating adult."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1025640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020820, "text": "And I've had enough of him trying to\nexploit me and take advantage of me. He"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1030359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025640, "text": "took my affections, he used them for his\ngain, and then he threw me away like an"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1031359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030359, "text": "old shoe."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1032720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1031720, "text": "I've had it!"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1035640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033280, "text": "I don't care if he lives or if he dies."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1039079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037900, "text": "I just want him to get that."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1073240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066920, "text": "or no, Judge, that was vicious,\nsadistic, cruel, dirty, rotten... Slimy?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1077740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076740, "text": "Synonyms are my life."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1082340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081340, "text": "Bye."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1088240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1085140, "text": "Miss Sullivan, do you have any idea what\nyou just said to me?"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1091000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090000, "text": "Yes, sir, I do."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1093440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092440, "text": "Well, you're right."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1101250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099490, "text": "Oh, yes. So am I."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1103190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101610, "text": "I thought you said Leon had to go."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1105690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103670, "text": "He wouldn't have gotten 25 feet."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1109470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105910, "text": "Mac, call security downstairs. Tell the\nboys at the door they can go."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1110830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109830, "text": "My pleasure, sir."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1113030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111730, "text": "Excuse me, sir. What's going on?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1115230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114050, "text": "Leon wasn't going anywhere."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1120050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115990, "text": "The minute Mrs. Lund told me he was in\nNew York, I had security seal off this"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1123430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120050, "text": "building. He could get in, but there was\nno way he was going to get out."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1125890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124590, "text": "You mean you lied to me?"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1127350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1126350, "text": "Of course."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1130010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129010, "text": "I'm an adult."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1137650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132230, "text": "Sometimes adults have to do a lot of\nthings that they don't really want to"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1139050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138050, "text": "Like lie?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1140610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139370, "text": "If it comes to that."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1142430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140990, "text": "Even though they don't want to."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1148490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143550, "text": "Just like they don't want to have to\ninstill fear into a young, beautiful,"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1149590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148590, "text": "innocent mind."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1152030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150410, "text": "But sometimes they got to."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1155510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152810, "text": "Because a kid's got to learn sooner than\nlater."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1160900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156880, "text": "that there are bad people out there that\ndon't cherish them and love them the"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1161900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160900, "text": "way that we do."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1164920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163340, "text": "You need somebody, Leon."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1172300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168800, "text": "When you left me the last time, I hurt\nreal bad."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1179080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173840, "text": "And nobody, not even you, is ever going\nto put me through that again."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1183880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181280, "text": "You mean you'd hunt me down like a dog\nif I ran out of here?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1189540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186139, "text": "I'd tie you with a leather strap and\nfeed you with a tube if I had to."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1193140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191900, "text": "I love you too, Harry."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1203260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202260, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1208380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206920, "text": "You okay, big guy?"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1218740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216220, "text": "Understand. I'm not in trouble anymore."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1221980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220980, "text": "Leon."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1224000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222200, "text": "Hi, Mrs. Lund. Guess what?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1226880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224280, "text": "Harry's going to tie me with a leather\nstrap and feed me through a tube."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1230220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227760, "text": "Oh, isn't that nice?"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1233900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231220, "text": "Can I please have some parents now, Mrs.\nLund? Please, can I?"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1237700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234780, "text": "Leon, this is quite a change of attitude\nfor you. What happened?"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1242420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238520, "text": "Well, Harry convinced me that despite my\ndelusions of maturity..."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1245670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242910, "text": "It would be better developmentally for\nme to have a more structured,"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1247290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245870, "text": "authoritarian environment."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1250990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248910, "text": "Yeah, that's what I said."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1255170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251970, "text": "Hey, Harry, do you think after they find\nme a home you could come by sometime"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1257470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255170, "text": "and show me how to push those fishhooks\ninto my eyeballs?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1263610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260450, "text": "Oh, I guess it would be all right."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1266690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265610, "text": "What have I become?"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1269670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268670, "text": "See you later, Harry."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1270870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269870, "text": "See you, Leon."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1272170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271170, "text": "Hey, hey."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1273980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272620, "text": "Why did you come back?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1276980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274380, "text": "I mean, you knew that there was a chance\nthat I was going to grab you."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1279040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277840, "text": "I was counting on it."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1281520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279760, "text": "But you told me you didn't want me to."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1286240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282540, "text": "Hey, how can I lie as an adult if I\ndon't get in a little practice now?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1289200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288000, "text": "Get out of here."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1292100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289780, "text": "Mr. Blunt, wait till you see the Fisher\ngang."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1294120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292460, "text": "There's this fake blood that oozes out."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1296620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294960, "text": "I didn't squeeze the eyeballs."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1302230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298940, "text": "Boy, you sure had us going. there, sir."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1305710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1302750, "text": "You had us really believing you didn't\ncare about Leon anymore."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1311150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306310, "text": "Really? You mean it wasn't obvious that\nI was just acting? Oh, it was obvious."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1314030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311450, "text": "Yeah, that's what I thought. It was\nobvious to you guys, wasn't it?"}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1315430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1314430, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1322830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319790, "text": "I only have three active brain cells,\nChristine."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1327250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325630, "text": "And even I knew."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1334180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331240, "text": "In other words, the only two people that\ndidn't know were the 12 -year -old and"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1335180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334180, "text": "me."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1338600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337600, "text": "Got your nose."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1341960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340180, "text": "You're dying to check, aren't you?"}
